  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Which modernization path fits this workload?",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 4.160620525059666,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "The Enterprise Architect specialist compares the evidence across six canonical",
      "start": 4.160620525059666,
      "end": 8.89021479713604,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "dispositions, through Ask EMOS and the governed assessment experience.",
      "start": 8.89021479713604,
      "end": 14.010978520286397,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "Retain means Govern and Monitor. Retire means Safely Decommission.",
      "start": 14.010978520286397,
      "end": 19.896300715990456,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Rehost means Migrate Infrastructure.",
      "start": 19.896300715990456,
      "end": 23.09677804295943,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Replatform means Transition Platform.",
      "start": 23.09677804295943,
      "end": 25.781622911694512,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Refactor means Transform Architecture.",
      "start": 25.781622911694512,
      "end": 28.537589498806682,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Repurchase means Replace and Adopt.",
      "start": 28.537589498806682,
      "end": 30.404534606205253,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Review the recommendation, rationale, alternatives, risks, constraints, and the evidence",
      "start": 30.404534606205253,
      "end": 37.90787589498807,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "that could change the decision. Target-platform claims must follow verified target-state",
      "start": 37.90787589498807,
      "end": 43.22422434367542,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "evidence; EMOS should not invent a cloud choice.",
      "start": 43.22422434367542,
      "end": 46.31801909307876,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "New evidence can inform a follow-up assessment.",
      "start": 46.31801909307876,
      "end": 49.19844868735084,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Confidence does not equal readiness, and readiness does not equal approval.",
      "start": 49.19844868735084,
      "end": 53.48353221957041,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, resolve critical gaps, examine rejected alternatives, and bring the decision to an",
      "start": 53.48353221957041,
      "end": 58.69319809069213,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "accountable human.",
      "start": 58.69319809069213,
